## Sample output — samples write to <repo>/images/ via SamplesPath helper.
## Anything that escapes to repo root or Samples/ from a stale build is ignored.
## images/ is whitelisted via the explicit !/images/** rule below.
Samples/**/*.svg
Samples/**/*.png
Samples/**/*.pdf
Samples/**/*.gif
/*.svg
/*.png
/*.pdf
/*.gif
!/images/**
# The package icon is a SOURCE file, not a rendered stray: Directory.Build.props packs it into all
# fourteen packages, and a pack on a checkout without it fails with NU5046.
!/icon.png

